            "text": "| Property | Alpha (α) | Beta (β) | Gamma (γ) |\n|----------|-----------|----------|----------|\n| Nature | He nucleus | Electron | EM wave |\n| Symbol | $^4_2 He$ | $^0_{-1} e$ | γ |\n| Charge | +2 | −1 | 0 |\n| Mass (u) | 4 | ~0 | 0 |\n| Speed | ~5% c | up to 90% c | c |\n| Ionising | Strong | Medium | Weak |\n| Penetrating | Weak | Medium | Strong |\n| Stopped by | Paper | Aluminium | Thick lead |"
          }
        ]
